# Local config — holds the public wallet address + network only (decision #9).
# Never commit; secrets (API keys, agent-wallet private key) live in env vars.
*.local.yaml

# Environment files with secrets
.env

# Trading stores. The RUNBOOK runs the CLI from the repo root with a relative
# --db, so live_trading.db / paper_trading.db land in the working tree. They
# hold the full order/fill/position history, account equity and the genesis
# config snapshot — no secrets (the agent key never reaches the store), but
# real trading activity that must never be one `git add -A` from being
# published. Only Django's db.sqlite3 was covered by the root .gitignore
# (2026-07-30 security review). `payloads/` is already ignored at the root.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal
